/**
 * A static snapshot of SAPOL's public "Fixed camera locations" table,
 * originally produced by scripts/buildFixedCameraDataset.js. That script
 * now ingests SAPOL's data straight into the central `fixed_cameras`
 * Postgres table instead (see server/schema.sql) - this file is no
 * longer regenerated by it, and only serves as tripRuntime.ts's offline
 * fallback for when the live `/api/cameras` fetch fails.
 *
 * Only Mid Block (open-road fixed speed cameras), P2P (point-to-point
 * average-speed cameras) and I/section (intersection combo cameras, which
 * also enforce speed) location types were ever included - SAPOL's
 * PAC/Rail/MPDC types enforce pedestrian-crossing/level-crossing/phone-use,
 * not speed - but the distinction between them was never read by any
 * logic (selectSpeedCameraWarning.ts only uses position), so it isn't
 * captured here.
 */
